770" end="00:33.520">leaves </span><span begin="00:33.520" end="00:35.740">finally</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.070" end="00:41.530"><span begin="00:36.070" end="00:36.580">Now </span><span begin="00:36.580" end="00:37.060">I </span><span begin="00:37.060" end="00:38.020">can </span><span begin="00:38.020" end="00:38.650">take </span><span begin="00:38.650" end="00:39.520">her </span><span begin="00:39.520" end="00:41.530">man</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.240" end="00:48.340"><span begin="00:43.240" end="00:44.170">Someone </span><span begin="00:44.170" end="00:44.620">told </span><span begin="00:44.620" end="00:44.830">me </span><span begin="00:44.830" end="00:45.550">stay </span><span begin="00:45.550" end="00:46.180">away </span><span begin="00:46.180" end="00:46.420">from </span><span begin="00:46.420" end="00:46.960">things </span><span begin="00:46.960" end="00:47.230">that </span><span begin="00:47.230" end="00:47.770">aren</span><span begin="00:47.770" end="00:47.800">’</span><span begin="00:47.800" end="00:47.860">t </span><span begin="00:47.860" end="00:48.340">yours</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.460" end="00:55.510"><span begin="00:48.460" end="00:48.760">But </span><span begin="00:48.760" end="00:49.180">was </span><span begin="00:49.180" end="00:49.420">he </span><span begin="00:49.420" end="00:49.900">yours </span><span begin="00:49.900" end="00:50.050">if </span><span begin="00:50.050" end="00:50.170">he </span><span begin="00:50.170" end="00:50.800">wanted </span><span begin="00:50.800" end="00:51.040">me </span><span begin="00:51.040" end="00:51.670">so </span><span begin="00:51.670" end="00:53.140">bad</span><span begin="00:53.140" end="00:55.510">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.510" end="00:57.160"><span begin="00:55.510" end="00:56.950">Pacify </span><span begin="00:56.950" end="00:57.160">her</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.810" end="01:01.450"><span begin="00:58.810" end="00:59.230">She</sp