560">Stop </span><span begin="01:17.560" end="01:18.340">lying </span><span begin="01:18.340" end="01:18.760">with </span><span begin="01:18.760" end="01:19.420">those </span><span begin="01:19.420" end="01:20.380">words</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.150" end="01:36.610"><span begin="01:31.150" end="01:31.870">I </span><span begin="01:31.870" end="01:32.500">can</span><span begin="01:32.500" end="01:32.530">’</span><span begin="01:32.530" end="01:32.590">t </span><span begin="01:32.590" end="01:33.550">stand </span><span begin="01:33.550" end="01:34.270">her </span><span begin="01:34.270" end="01:36.610">whining</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.940" end="01:42.940"><span begin="01:36.940" end="01:37.870">Where</span><span begin="01:37.870" end="01:37.900">’</span><span begin="01:37.900" end="01:38.050">s </span><span begin="01:38.050" end="01:38.770">her </span><span begin="01:38.770" end="01:40.300">binky </span><span begin="01:40.300" end="01:41.560">now</span><span begin="01:41.560" end="01:42.940">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.940" end="01:48.160"><span begin="01:42.940" end="01:43.330">And </span><span begin="01:43.330" end="01:44.770">loving </span><span begin="01:44.770" end="01:45.520">her </span><span begin="01:45.520" end="01:46.390">seems </span><span begin="01:46.390" end="01:48.160">tiring</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.880" end="01:55.240"><span begin="01:48.880" end="01:49.420">So </span><span begin="01:49.420" end="01:49.990">boy</span><span begin="01:49.990" end="01:50.170">, </span><span begin="01:50.170" end="01:51.040">just </span><span begin="01:51.040" end="01:51.700">love </span><span begin="01:51.700" end="01:52.270">me</span><span begin="01:52.270" end="01:52.450">, </span><span begin="01:52.450" end="01:53.260">down</span><span begin="01:53.260" end="01:53.260">, </span><span begin="01:53.260" end="01:53.980">down</span><span begin="01:53.980" end="01:53.980">, </span><span begin="01:53.980" end="01